<loader>Equipment::BaseItem::LoadMultiple</loader>
%// HammerwatchPlus Fishing: every fish is a one-handed sword (it swings like a longsword
%// and takes the same enchantments). They only come from fishing (the false conditional
%// keeps them out of random drops and shops); the item level is set when caught (the floor's
%// drop level, NG+ included). 1-star fish are common, 2-star uncommon, 3-star rare (they
%// get that quality's modifiers when caught, like dropped gear), and they sell for
%// 1 / 3 / 5 bet tokens while nobody enchanted, upgraded or rerolled them. Icons: items/hwp/fish.png (tools/generate/make_fish_icons.py).
